AGENTS.md

# ── Linux/Docker installers of the full build; the edition is Windows-first
#    and carries its own test image under docker/ ────────────────────────────
system/install/linux/
system/install/docker/
system/install/seed_epi_base.py
system/install/seed_ph_database.py
